{"shortDescription":"The British pound steadied just below $1.35, hovering around its weakest level since early August, as investors digested an in-line UK inflation report ahead of interest rate decisions from both the Bank of England and the US Federal Reserve.UK annual inflation accelerated to 3.1% in August from 2…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The British pound steadied just below $1.35, hovering around its weakest level since early August, as investors digested an in-line UK inflation report ahead of interest rate decisions from both the Bank of England and the US Federal Reserve."]},{"type":"p","children":["UK annual inflation accelerated to 3.1% in August from 2.9% in July, in line with expectations and largely reflecting higher fuel costs."]},{"type":"p","children":["Core CPI, which strips out more volatile components, was unchanged at 2.6%, while services inflation, a key focus for the Bank of England, came in at 3.4%, slightly below expectations of 3.5%."]},{"type":"p","children":["No rate change is expected from the BoE on Thursday, while a November hike remains priced in with less conviction."]},{"type":"p","children":["Markets have also pared back expectations for hikes through the end of next year, with four now priced versus five previously."]},{"type":"p","children":["Elsewhere, the US dollar remained supported ahead of the Fed decision, with policymakers widely expected to raise rates for the first time in around three years."]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Forex","args":[{"id":"category","value":"forex"}]},{"title":"Trading Economics","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"trading-economics"}]}],"id":"te_news:584136:0","title":"Sterling Steadies Ahead of BoE and Fed Decisions","published":1789543453,"urgency":2,"link":"https://tradingeconomics.com/united-kingdom/currency","permission":"preview","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"FX:GBPUSD","currency-logoid":"country/US","base-currency-logoid":"country/GB","logo"